---

## **WHY HIERARCHY SAVES TOKENS/CREDITS**

### **1. Smart Routing (Input Classifier)**
```
Without: Every agent processes everything
With:    Only 100 tokens to route to right agent
Savings: 90% reduction in wasted tokens
```

### **2. Specialized Agents**
```
Without: One agent carries 10 department knowledge bases
With:    Each agent has 1 focused knowledge base
Savings: Smaller context windows, faster inference
```

### **3. Escalation Only When Needed**
```
Without: Agent tries 5 times before escalating
With:    Fast escalation to right specialist
Savings: Fewer failed attempts = fewer tokens
```

### **4. Caching at Layers**
```
Layer 1: Strategic decisions cached (weekly)
Layer 2: Operational patterns cached (daily)
Agents:  Responses cached (hourly)
Savings: Repeated queries don't hit API
```

